<title>USA: Amtran unit, Teamsters ratify pact.</title>
<headline>Amtran unit, Teamsters ratify pact.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS, Ind. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Trans Air Inc, the principal subsidiary of Amtran Inc, said Wednesday the company's cockpit crewmembers have ratified a tentative agreement reached on August 6.</p>
<p>It said 84 percent of the members voting approved the four-year pact.</p>
<p>This is the initial contract for American Trans Air's cockpit crewmembers with the International Brotherhood of Teamsters.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
